window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Carter Renzo</b><br> <br> I have a past my brothers don't know about.<br> <br> She was mine when I was forced to leave. I had to die to keep her safe. A <i>gift </i>from my father...<br> <br> But nothing could make me keep my end of the deal to remain buried when she is taken. The ground opens up and swallows me whole when I hear of another man wanting to claim her... forcing her into a marriage that should have been mine. The families of Michigan were run by ruthless men. But none of them knew what I had become. I will get her back and damn everyone who gets in my way.<br> <br> If it takes my last breath, I will gladly spend it reclaiming what is mine.</p> <p><i>Carter and Callie's story is a standalone, steamy, protective cartel romance with a guaranteed HEA.<br> *Contains graphic scenes that may cause triggers, rape, torture, adult language, kidnapping, and sexual scenes.<br> <br> </i><b><i>Other books by Gracin Sawyer</i></b><br> <br> <b>Men of Cardosa Ranch Series<br> </b><i>Branding Lily – Jacob and Lily’s story</i><br> <i>I'll Be What She Wants - Diesel and Samantha's story<br> Take Me Back - Carter and Callie's story<br> Whiskey Burn - Jax and Bryer's story<br> Burnt Skies - Bear and Hailey's story<br> Falling for London - Fox and Cadence's story</i></p>"; 
